Solving a New 3D Bin Packing Problem with Deep Reinforcement Learning Method
Haoyuan Hu, Xiaodong Zhang, Xiaowei Yan, Longfei Wang, Yinghui Xu Artiﬁcial Intelligence Department, Zhejiang Cainiao Supply Chain Management Co., Ltd., Hangzhou, China
haoyuan.huhy@cainiao.com, yuhui.zxd@cainiao.com, xiaowei.yanxw@cainiao.com, shouchu.wlf@cainiao.com, renji.xyh@taobao.com

